{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06TD", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0002": "$(U', R', s', t', c')$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{C}_\\Lambda$", "MATH_0004": "$\\varphi : [U/R] \\to [U'/R']$", "MATH_0005": "$\\varphi$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-minimal-prorepresentable-groupoid-equivalence}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:6d5ed4357308bca0de56c7ba8ea2c14641e2af0f81ab0cb78b600f4ee1de76e3", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6acc661a6af8cf51c608a96c5898b3585202ccdc6c39d5571a19b733e880b53e", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002> be minimal smooth\nprorepresentable groupoids in functors on <MATH_0003>. If\n<MATH_0004> is an equivalence of categories cofibered\nin groupoids, then <MATH_0005> is an isomorphism.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:58343f9e81921b51852c564bfc0f5bde72591d7190fa51ff4a498b13f0fc21b4", "unit_id": "tag:06KR:statement"}
{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06TD", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\psi : [U'/R'] \\to [U/R]$", "MATH_0002": "$\\varphi$", "MATH_0003": "$\\psi \\circ \\varphi$", "MATH_0004": "$\\varphi \\circ \\psi$", "MATH_0005": "$\\varphi$", "MATH_0006": "$\\psi$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-minimal-prorepresentable-groupoid-autoequivalence}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:01037ec9a60be925a8946d66270449846fda8670b0966da5015a21c0742ad51b", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2a1fd1bb3428079dcf672d533c8804382a741a62490fedd8e8cf5324ecbae7dc", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a quasi-inverse to <MATH_0002>.\nThen <MATH_0003> and <MATH_0004> are isomorphisms by\nLemma <REF_0001>,\nhence <MATH_0005> and <MATH_0006> are isomorphisms.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2ffb4b4082c5f69f385b3499bd498b386fa9b155fd8913fb820593e3c709eedb", "unit_id": "tag:06KR:proof"}
{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06TD", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:cc951c79e6def3f4c5c58e646d5a652f0a454afdc34d024203c64514fa7f4fa3", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe following lemma summarizes some of the things we have seen earlier\nin this chapter.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:789f01e19c28150ea97b8310d870b7fc549dc938c48c2ceb7a5412f13d0fadd5", "unit_id": "tag:06TD:prose-0004"}
